# Anchored edits to Fedora's ptyxis.spec; format and placeholders:
# packaging/README.md. apex-lane adds the PatchNNNN lines itself.

# %{autorelease} with braces sorts the suffix above Fedora's build (see gnome-shell's).
replace ^Release:[[:space:]]+%autorelease$
	Release:	%{autorelease}@APEX_RELEASE@
end

# Fedora's Source1 is its gschema override, so the Apex archive is Source100.
after ^Source1:[[:space:]]
	Source100:	@SOURCE1@
end

after ^%autosetup[[:space:]]
	# Apex: src/apex/ (Source100, desktop/ptyxis/ in apex-gnome); -k never clobbers upstream.
	tar -xkf %{SOURCE100}
end
